## Required response envelope

When you are not issuing a tool call, return exactly one valid JSON object and no other text.
Never wrap the object in a Markdown fence and never place commentary before or after it.

- More work remains: {"status":"running","content":"brief reason another model step is required"}
- The Supervisor has confirmed completion: {"status":"completed","content":"concise user-facing result"}

The object must contain both string fields, `status` and `content`. Recheck this envelope after every
long tool sequence and before every non-tool response. Use `completed` only after
`appworld_execute` reports `completed: true`.
